  "notes": "{行|い}き{詰|づ}まる means to reach a point where progress is no longer possible.\n\nCONJUGATION (godan verb):\n- Dictionary: {行|い}き{詰|づ}まる\n- Negative: {行|い}き{詰|づ}まらない\n- Past: {行|い}き{詰|づ}まった\n- Te-form: {行|い}き{詰|づ}まって\n\nCOMMON SUBJECTS:\n- {交渉|こうしょう}が{行|い}き{詰|づ}まる (negotiations stall)\n- {計画|けいかく}が{行|い}き{詰|づ}まる (plan hits a dead end)\n- {経営|けいえい}が{行|い}き{詰|づ}まる (management reaches an impasse)\n\nRELATED: {行|い}き{詰|づ}まり (noun: deadlock, impasse)",
